OL,3,GNEWSASchool joins BBC for Children in
OL,4,ANeed challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school in West Sussex has
OL,7,Fraised more than #4,800 for BBC
OL,8,FChildren in Need through a series of
OL,9,Ffitness challenges.
OL,11,FThe charity has been inviting people to
OL,12,Ftake on their own challenges inspired
OL,13,Fby the number 26, as part of the
OL,14,FChallenge Yourself 2026 campaign.
OL,16,FSt Nicolas & St Mary CE Primary School
OL,17,Fin Shoreham-by-Sea raised the sum
OL,18,Fthrough sponsored timed fitness
OL,19,Fchallenges, donation buckets and a sale
OL,20,Fof Children in Need goodies.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
